      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into issue/864-reduced-fidelity\n\n#839 merged to main; this PR now targets main. One conflict,\ncrates/app/src/commands/update_model.rs: both sides added fields and a\nbuilder to UpdateModel (#826's plate snapshot and keeping_plate; #864's\ncoarse_mm / prev_coarse_mm, with_fidelity and keeping_fidelity). Both are\nkept, apply and invert write both. section.rs merged clean: main's union\narc reading and the model_excess floor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
