      "message": "test(verify): the union arc joints are judged against the tightened floor\n\nWith a positive model_excess, a sharp vertex on an old arc joint (one no\nquarter joint stands near, #689 review B1) is convicted between the plain\nand the tightened floor in Boundary mode, clean outside it, and reads as\nfull fidelity once the excess uses the whole tolerance.\n\nRefs #864\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
