      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into issue/864-reduced-fidelity\n\nmain moved during the gate (#843 reach laws read the band stack, #913\nbuild cache). One conflict, crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs, at the\ntwo contain_into calls: main passes its shared `cutter` where the tool\nwas, this branch adds the model's excess as a last argument. Both kept.\nThe two test contexts #843 added (tool_body_bands, tool_body_judged) take\nthe struct-update base for model_excess.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
